    "paragraph": "Sidewalk Stewards introduces a visual analytics platform designed for interactive topology repair of aerial-extracted sidewalk networks. A study of metadata completeness across the Harvard Dataverse constructs a metadata knowledge graph to demonstrate how geospatial locations link research datasets across disciplines. Finally, fieldwork with three blind adults in Presidente Prudente, Brazil, details how spatial experience is constructed through geometric forms and abstract environmental landmarks.",
